// Vitest-only stand-in for "@prisma/client", aliased in vitest.config.ts.
//
// The real client is generated by `prisma generate` from prisma/schema.prisma,
// which requires downloading a native engine binary — unavailable in this
// sandbox and, more importantly, not something a test suite should depend on
// to run at all. This shim exists so `npm test` works identically whether or
// not `prisma generate` has been run.
//
// IMPORTANT: the enum values below are copied from prisma/schema.prisma and
// will drift if that file changes without this one being updated. This is a
// deliberate, documented tradeoff — not an oversight — but if enum tests
// start failing after a schema change, check here first.

